Member-3 detail (13:48:04, unit id 3, single registers): port3.0.13 (index 12, block 0x509c)
0x509c = 0xf103 (UP/full/auto/1000), 0x509d = 0xf000, input bytes 11906, output bytes 612704 vs
CLI 4 s later "Link is UP … input … bytes 12996 … output … bytes 614165" (the tb link carries the
