No `write`, no boot change, no IPv6 added; consoles left at an exec prompt with `terminal no monitor`.

## Verdict line
PARTIAL — 22653-partial.log. Steps 1,2,6,7 PASS; steps 3,4,5 unsupported by platform (no PoE
